# A moving fix (10.1 knots, course 70): the heading wedge and the speed in the chip, "3D fix 9 sats, 19 km/h".
title GPS: moving, heading wedge, speed
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_GPS auto
env DECKATLAS_GPS_FEED moving
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.889643,2.269995,16

wait 1500
shot moving
expect text "3D fix 9 sats, 19 km/h"
